// fixture -> Store/Tests/Seal.jet7 store_test_seal_fixture(..., "seal-test").
// Rust: crates/jetpack/src/Store/SealTests.rs:39
// fixture_with_platform_artifact_kind -> Store/Tests/Seal.jet7:
// exact trusted payload, name/version/reference/source/recipe/policy/platform,
